  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "A projectile is projected with velocity of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> at an angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi></math> with the horizontal. After <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math> seconds its inclination with horizontal becomes zero. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> represents horizontal range of the projectile, the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi></math> will be : [use <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>use</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>]",
    "image": null
  },
